#: ../../data-import.rst:2
msgid "Importing data"
msgstr "导入数据"

#: ../../data-import.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit reads the common genomics formats directly. Drag a file onto the "
"window, or press the **Import** button in the toolbar. The format is "
"chosen by extension."
msgstr "Orbit 直接读取常见的基因组格式。把文件拖进窗口，或点工具栏的 **导入**。格式按扩展名判断。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:9
msgid "Supported formats"
msgstr "支持的格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:15
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-import.rst:16
msgid "Extension"
msgstr "扩展名"

#: ../../data-import.rst:17
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../data-import.rst:18 ../../data-import.rst:35
msgid "bigWig"
msgstr "bigWig"

#: ../../data-import.rst:19
msgid "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"
msgstr "``.bw`` ``.bigWig``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:20
msgid "Random access, no indexing step. Best choice for signal."
msgstr "随机访问，无需建索引。信号轨道的首选。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:21 ../../data-import.rst:57
msgid "bedGraph"
msgstr "bedGraph"

#: ../../data-import.rst:22
msgid "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"
msgstr "``.bedGraph`` ``.bdg``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:23
msgid "Loaded into memory; fine up to a few hundred MB."
msgstr "整份读进内存；几百 MB 以内没问题。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:24 ../../data-import.rst:77
msgid "BAM"
msgstr "BAM"

#: ../../data-import.rst:25
msgid "``.bam``"
msgstr "``.bam``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:26
msgid ""
"Coverage and stacked reads are computed from the file directly; a "
"``.bai`` is optional."
msgstr "覆盖度与堆叠 reads 直接从文件计算；``.bai`` 索引可选。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:27 ../../data-import.rst:101
msgid "GTF / GFF3"
msgstr "GTF / GFF3"

#: ../../data-import.rst:28
msgid "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"
msgstr "``.gtf`` ``.gff`` ``.gff3``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:29
msgid "Becomes a gene track; UTR and CDS features are kept."
msgstr "变成一个基因轨道；UTR 和 CDS 特征都会保留。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:30 ../../data-import.rst:128
msgid "FASTA"
msgstr "FASTA"

#: ../../data-import.rst:31
msgid "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"
msgstr "``.fa`` ``.fasta``"

#: ../../data-import.rst:32
msgid "Registers the file as a local sequence source for the current assembly."
msgstr "把该文件注册为当前装配的本地序列来源。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:37
msgid ""
"The recommended format. Orbit parses the index itself, so there is no "
"``bigWigToBedGraph`` step and no conversion. Multi-sample overlays work "
"best when the files share a coordinate system."
msgstr "推荐格式。Orbit 自己解析索引，不需要 ``bigWigToBedGraph`` 转换。多样本叠加时，文件之间共用坐标系效果最好。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:45
msgid ""
"The track appears immediately with autoscale on. Open its label to pin "
"the range if you want several samples to share one scale."
msgstr "轨道会立刻出现，默认自动缩放。想让多个样本共用同一量程，就打开轨道标签把范围固定下来。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:52
msgid ""
"A ribo-seq ``.bw`` track imported onto hg38. The signal is added to the "
"signal panel with autoscale on, and its label (``Scr_R1_IP``) appears in "
"the left sidebar."
msgstr "导入到 hg38 的 ribo-seq ``.bw`` 轨道。信号被加入信号面板并自动缩放，左侧栏显示其标签（``Scr_R1_IP``）。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:59
msgid ""
"Plain text, four columns (``chrom  start  end  value``). Convenient for "
"small, hand-made tracks; a genome-wide file will cost memory, so prefer "
"bigWig above a few hundred megabytes. Orbit renders bedGraph exactly like"
" bigWig — same signal panel, same autoscale, same colour controls."
msgstr ""
"纯文本，四列（``chrom  start  end  value``）。适合小型手工轨道；全基因组级别会吃内存，超过几百 MB 建议改用 "
"bigWig。Orbit 渲染 bedGraph 与 bigWig 完全一致——同一信号面板、同样的自动缩放与配色控件。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:72
msgid ""
"A four-column ``.bedGraph`` file on hg38, rendered identically to a "
"bigWig signal track. Both go through the same drawing path, so you can "
"mix ``.bw`` and ``.bedGraph`` in one view."
msgstr ""
"hg38 上的四列 ``.bedGraph`` 文件，渲染效果与 bigWig 信号轨道完全一致。两者走同一条绘制路径，因此可以在同一视图里混用 "
"``.bw`` 与 ``.bedGraph``。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:79
msgid ""
"Orbit reads the alignments straight from the ``.bam`` — there is no "
"separate indexing step and a ``.bai`` is optional. Coverage and the "
"stacked reads are computed from the reads in the visible window only, "
"which keeps memory flat but means the first draw of a new region takes a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Orbit 直接从 ``.bam`` 读取比对记录——无需单独的建索引步骤，``.bai`` 可选。覆盖度与堆叠 reads 只按可见窗口内的 "
"reads 计算，内存占用平稳，代价是首次绘制新区域要等一下。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:88
msgid ""
"Each BAM produces two linked views: a **coverage** track (the blue area) "
"and an **alignment** track (the grey stacked reads). Toggle them "
"independently from the track label."
msgstr "每个 BAM 会生成两条联动视图：覆盖度轨道（蓝色区域）和比对轨道（灰色堆叠 reads）。可在轨道标签处分别开关。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:96
msgid ""
"A BAM imported onto hg38, shown at ``chr1:11.79–11.81 Mb``. The blue "
"track is read coverage; the striped block below it is the stacked "
"alignments. The bundled RefSeq track (``MTHFR``, ``CLCN6``) sits above "
"for context."
msgstr ""
"导入到 hg38 的 BAM，显示在 ``chr1:11.79–11.81 Mb``。蓝色轨道是 reads "
"覆盖度；其下方的条纹块是堆叠的比对记录。上方是内置的 RefSeq 轨道（``MTHFR``、``CLCN6``）作为参照。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:103
msgid ""
"Imported annotations become a normal gene track: expandable transcripts, "
"strand colours, labels. Transcript and CDS features are preserved, so a "
"GTF exported from StringTie or Ensembl looks the way you expect. "
"Chromosome naming is reconciled automatically, so Ensembl-style ``1`` / "
"``I`` maps onto UCSC-style ``chr1`` / ``chrI``."
msgstr ""
"导入的注释会成为普通基因轨道：可展开转录本、按链着色、带标签。转录本与 CDS 特征都会保留，所以 StringTie 或 Ensembl 导出的"
" GTF 看起来就是你预期的样子。染色体命名会自动对齐，因此 Ensembl 风格的 ``1`` / ``I`` 会映射到 UCSC 风格的 "
"``chr1`` / ``chrI``。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:117
msgid ""
"A yeast GTF (``representative_transcripts.gtf``) imported onto sacCer3 "
"and shown directly under the bundled RefSeq track. Gene names and strand "
"arrows are drawn for both."
msgstr ""
"导入到 sacCer3 的酵母 GTF（``representative_transcripts.gtf``），直接显示在内置 RefSeq "
"轨道下方。两条轨道都会画出基因名与链方向箭头。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:123
msgid ""
"Imported annotations are not converted to the built-in binary format. "
"They are read on load, which is fine for a few hundred thousand features "
"but slower than the bundled RefSeq index."
msgstr "导入的注释不会转成内置二进制格式，而是加载时现读。几十万条特征没问题，但比内置的 RefSeq 索引慢。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:130
msgid ""
"Loading a FASTA registers it as the local sequence source for the "
"assembly. This is how you use Orbit fully offline, or work with an "
"assembly that UCSC does not host."
msgstr "载入 FASTA 会把它注册为该装配的本地序列来源。这是完全离线使用 Orbit 的办法，也适用于 UCSC 上没有的装配。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:138
msgid ""
"Large FASTA files are memory-mapped, so a 3 GB genome does not need 3 GB "
"of RAM — but the first access to a chromosome still costs a disk read."
msgstr "大 FASTA 采用内存映射，3 GB 的基因组不需要 3 GB 内存——但首次访问某条染色体仍要读一次磁盘。"

#: ../../data-import.rst:142
msgid "Where imported tracks live"
msgstr "导入的轨道存在哪"

#: ../../data-import.rst:144
msgid ""
"Importing copies the file into Orbit's per-user data directory "
"(``data/loaded``, or ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit/loaded`` when the install "
"directory is read-only), so the original file is no longer needed after "
"import. Imported tracks are session-scoped by default: set "
"``IGV_RESTORE_LOADED=1`` to restore them automatically on the next "
"launch."
msgstr ""
"导入会把文件复制到 Orbit 的用户数据目录（``data/loaded``；当安装目录只读时用 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit/loaded``），因此导入后原始文件不再需要保留。导入轨道默认是会话级的：设置 "
"``IGV_RESTORE_LOADED=1`` 可在下次启动时自动恢复。"

